{"seq":1,"mint":"F18","verb":"fact","status":"ok","model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","approach":"split","literals":true,"findings":[{"kind":"unevidenced","clause":"The label first becomes visible to the author one act later, inside the `fact` result: `mcp.rs:670-676` loads the pending buffer, builds `folded` via `facts::describe_buffer`, and ships it in `fact_result` — and by that point the note is already a parameter of the same call (`facts::FactRequest::Mint { note: p.note }`, mcp.rs:666), i.e. the assertion over the observation was supplied before the label was ever shown.","clause_quoted":true,"facts":[],"literal":"one act later","why":"The capture shows `folded` being passed to `fact_result`, but not that it contains the label or makes it visible; it therefore does not establish that the label appears one act later.","quoted":false}],"at":1790154010,"cost":0.003514131,"elapsed_ms":63384,"attempts":4,"not_verbatim":0,"literals_refuted":0,"not_a_quantity":0,"kind_off_verb":0,"refuted":0,"typed_versions":["jev-1.13.0"],"gate_calls":1}
